meta {
  name: 11 - Ingest (document upload)
  type: http
  seq: 11
}
post {
  url: {{base_url}}/ingest
  body: multipartForm
  auth: none
}
headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}
body:multipart-form {
  doc_type: intake_form
  patient_id: {{patient_with_documents}}
  file: @file()
}
docs {
  Week 2 document upload + extraction + OpenEMR write-back.

  Run 01 - Login first. Then attach a PDF to the `file` field in Bruno
  (click the field, choose a file). doc_type is intake_form or lab_pdf.

  On success returns: status=ingested, the extracted fields, and
  openemr_write=written -- the source PDF is persisted to the patient's
  OpenEMR record (document endpoint; FHIR writes are unavailable on
  OpenEMR 7.0.3, so the standard REST document API is used, which the
  spec permits as "OpenEMR records").
}
